<view class="page"><view class="title">上传素材</view><view class="muted">视频和照片将进入公司统一素材夹，并自动记录司机和时间。</view><view class="card picker" bindtap="chooseFiles"><view class="plus">＋</view><view class="pick-title">从相册选择照片或视频</view><view class="muted">支持多选，保留原始画质</view></view><view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="path" class="card file"><view class="row between"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.progress}}%</text></view><view class="bar"><view style="width:{{item.progress}}%"></view></view></view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="submit">全部上传完成</button></view>
